	TAD	T1		/ RESTORE INPUT BUFFER LENGTH		/A034
	CDFMNU
	DCA I	(MUBUF+MNILEN)	/					/A034

/D034	CDFMNU
	TAD I	(MUBUF+MNTMP1)
	CDFMYF
/
